{"agency_id": "climate-change-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/shorts/rg46GqYbkXA", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:47:48+00:00", "content": "Monitoring emissions reductions 2025: Is NZ on track?\n\nThe Climate Change Commission's annual report tracking Aotearoa New Zealand's progress on climate change budgets and targets is out now – so is the country on track in 2025? Chief Executive Jo Hendy shares some top takeaways from the report.\n\nOur new monitoring report shows NZ is likely to meet the first emissions budget – but the second and third emissions budgets are at risk:\n\n🟩 NZ is likely to meet the first emissions budget (2022–2025) – due in part to changes to accounting methods\n\n🟧 There are significant risks to achieving the second emissions budget (2026–2030).\n\n🟥 Current Government plans are insufficient to meet the third emissions budget (2031–2035).\n\n🟧 There are significant risks for meeting the 2050 target.\n\nRead the report and more info on our website: https://www.climatecommission.govt.nz/erm-2025?utm_source=youtube.com&amp;utm_campaign=erm-2025&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_content=short", "content_hash": "98ab053bc2cbaf398e0ada83939ca092e4f572af5b3cc4b24c5c0f94b997460f", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "source_id": "climate-change-commission-youtube-ac260476", "video_id": "rg46GqYbkXA"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-24T21:20:06+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-07\\ae16891bb104090aa69955d4.json", "record_id": "youtube:ae16891bb104090aa69955d4", "source_account": "UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvAJ21jjC9ynnMJ5rq0ZxVQ"}
{"agency_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=13XoTh6P7QM", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:34+00:00", "content": "Health care assistants care guide - our whakataukī and tohu\n\nThis video explains our approach to encompass both te ao Pākehā and te ao Māori views. This included the creation of taonga that resonate both to the kaupapa, and with everyone who has been involved in designing and implementing the guide.", "content_hash": "1bb2884aab071e24d5ce6989b217773b56ac397870dfb7ac08f472128b697161", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission-youtube-a1b00f74", "video_id": "13XoTh6P7QM"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-23T23:39:45+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-07\\e141bfa6c6920c963eaf0cf6.json", "record_id": "youtube:e141bfa6c6920c963eaf0cf6", "source_account": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q"}
{"agency_id": "kordia", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9aYSFomG7yM", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:48+00:00", "content": "A day in the life of a cyber security consultant\n\nWe chat with Kate who works with businesses to help keep them safe from cyber threats.  Kates talks us through a typical day, the most difficult challenges facing businesses when it comes to cyber security.  Also, how she stay's current with the rapidly evolving threat landscape and new technologies.", "content_hash": "840cf51797e4af489904f086807fcbac6b945b667f3b7aecbb580b3f8bba2af4", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "source_id": "kordia-youtube-2709f059", "video_id": "9aYSFomG7yM"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-23T05:46:16+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-07\\c7d6ab94a0b1d7c34a9b96bb.json", "record_id": "youtube:c7d6ab94a0b1d7c34a9b96bb", "source_account": "UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@KordiaGroup"}
{"agency_id": "kordia", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kmy4xCiQ2c4", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:48+00:00", "content": "A career in cyber security at Kordia.\n\nWe chat to cyber security consultant Kate.  Originally a journalist, Kate discussed a passion for hacking during the covid pandemic.  We  find out what sparked her interest in this fast growing area, what training she did and what she loves most about working in cyber security at Kordia!", "content_hash": "17f4075d7516fb7ab078f000681e9236845c05ef580e7b38145f10e78877aefb", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "source_id": "kordia-youtube-2709f059", "video_id": "Kmy4xCiQ2c4"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-23T04:50:33+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-07\\250ac0f2abf6c0cd3f7cc64b.json", "record_id": "youtube:250ac0f2abf6c0cd3f7cc64b", "source_account": "UCIsHTZ48t9cy6NtAKCD1EGA", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@KordiaGroup"}
{"agency_id": "linz", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fqq3Fzi5djc", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:54+00:00", "content": "He Kete Mātauranga: Bringing Whenua Stories to Life\n\nNau mai, haere mai! This video is a recording of a special Ngā Poutama Matawhenua wānanga held on 13 June 2025.\n\nJoin Keith Holswich (Ngāti Rahiri, Te Atiawa, Taranaki) as he shares the powerful story of He Kete Mātauranga – a grassroots GIS system built by, for, and with hapū to protect, manage, and connect with their whenua.\n\nIn this session you’ll discover:\n• How Ngāti Rahiri set up their own “kete” of digital whenua knowledge\n• Real case studies of protecting wāhi tapu, supporting Takutai Moana claims, and working with councils and industry\n• Why historic aerials, Māori Land Court data, and local mātauranga are the backbone of their GIS\n• Keith’s practical tips, hard lessons, and ideas for any hapū, iwi, marae or Māori Land Trust wanting to start their own mapping kaupapa\n\nThis wānanga is for everyone: trustees, administrators, kaitiaki, planners, rangatahi, or anyone passionate about whenua, digital taonga, and mātauranga Māori. No tech skills needed – just an interest in learning how GIS can uplift your community and tell the real stories of your whenua.\n\nLinks:\nKeith's email address: keith@ngatirahiri.co.nz\n \nThese 3 documents compiled by Keith and agreed to be shared online can be found at:\nhttps://www.linz.govt.nz/resources/nga-poutama-matawhenua-resources-ngati-rahiri\nNgāti Rāhiri Map Info GIS (April 2025)\nMapping the Whenua – 350 years of mapping Ngāti Rāhiri whenua (November 2024)\nGIS Case Study Ngāti Rāhiri (May 2025)\n \nAny iwi, hapū, or Māori Land Trust that wants to share their GIS or mapping journey or a specific geospatial project in a Ngā Poutama Matawhenua webinar can contact us at growgisnz@linz.govt.nz\n \nEmail for questions or feedback on the Ngā Poutama Matawhenua Practical Māori GIS Mapping Wānanga webinar series: growgisnz@linz.govt.nz", "content_hash": "e44df146434f31d7a536e6e35c9bf32a180c9c1af89c0043c57691de7648a4cd", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCwy3otxBoR6ArZTaH2vmfng", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCwy3otxBoR6ArZTaH2vmfng", "source_id": "linz-youtube-191b70cb", "video_id": "Fqq3Fzi5djc"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-07-02T21:33:07+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2025-07\\9aa10f87aff18c3a28eb0b51.json", "record_id": "youtube:9aa10f87aff18c3a28eb0b51", "source_account": "YouTube", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/user/linzvideoofficial"}
